From aa83bff1a2222435c1131bbdf687dd9f42970779 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jiang Xincong <xincongj@codeaurora.org>
Date: Thu, 17 Nov 2016 17:16:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] support all demo properties and fix some bugs

This is a totally workable version of AMB which support all demo
properties. These properties are available in canmatrix.h and customer
can define their own property in the same way.

Other functions in this commit:
1.fzone2pzone and pzone2fzone is done, so zone-property works
2.log info is enriched
3.ADDPROPERTY is dynamically loaded, so canplugin can make all changes
  with modifying canmatrix.h only.

Bug fix in this commit:
1.correct amb-set tool
2.correct the value type of some property
3.correct zone value pass

Signed-off-by: Jiang Xincong <xincongj@codeaurora.org>
